  "Do you eat at home or outdoor?": "I almost always eat at home, because it is healthier and much more budget-friendly. Home meals give me the freedom to choose fresh ingredients and cook exactly what I feel like eating. I do enjoy outdoor dining with friends from time to time, but for me it is a special occasion rather than a daily habit.",





