  "Why do some people prefer reading e-books?": "People choose e-books mainly for convenience and portability. You can store thousands of books in one small device and switch to any of them within seconds, which is perfect for travelling. E-books are also cheaper, environmentally friendly and let you increase the font size, which makes reading much more comfortable for many eyes.",





