  "Who is your best friend?": "My best friend is Bekzod, and we met in school at the age of ten. We share almost everything: football, movies and long conversations about the future. He always gives me honest advice, even when it is hard to hear. I truly consider him a second brother. I feel lucky to have someone I can trust completely.",





