  "What foreign languages have you studied?": "I have studied English seriously for about eight years, and I am currently learning Russian as a second language. I also tried a bit of Korean recently, mostly for fun, because I enjoy the culture. My main focus, though, is English, since it is the language of my future career. In the future, I would love to add German as a third serious language.",





  "What is your favorite hobby?": "My favourite hobby is photography, without a doubt. I love capturing ordinary moments, like sunlight through trees or people in the street, because they become priceless later. I usually shoot with my phone, since a professional camera is still expensive. It is my way of saving memories. And one day, I hope to upgrade my equipment and take it more seriously.",





