  "Tell me about your school.": "My school was a fairly big one, with about eight hundred students. It had two buildings, a large sports ground and a library I really liked. The teachers were strict but fair, and I still remember several of them fondly. Looking back, I think it gave me a solid foundation. Many of my childhood memories still live within those walls.",





